      "height": 200,
      "text": "# Air Dash\n\n- **Description**: Quick horizontal movement while airborne.\n- **Use Case**: Action games, Platformers.\n- **Difficulty**: Medium\n\n## Implementation Notes\n- Disable gravity during dash\n- Apply velocity in input direction\n- Set dash duration timer\n\n## References\n- [Mega Man X Dash Analysis](https://megaman.capcom.com)\n- [Celeste Dash Mechanics](https://celestegame.com)",
